      "description": "The Corgi U.S. Small-Cap 15% Structured Buffer ETF - September Series (SCSE) is an exchange-traded fund that mostly invests in downside hedge alternatives. The fund seeks to provide investors with returns that generally match the price return (excluding dividends) of the iShares Russell 2000 ETF, up to the upside cap of 18.30% while providing a buffer against the first 15% of iShares Russell 2000 ETF losses, over the period from September 1, 2026 to August 31, 2027. SCSE was launched on Sep 14, 2026 and is issued by Corgi.",
